    "description": "``RecursiveArrayIterator`` extends ``ArrayIterator`` to allow recursive iteration over nested arrays and objects. It implements ``RecursiveIterator``, so it works with ``RecursiveIteratorIterator`` to traverse multidimensional arrays depth-first.",
    "code": "<?php\n\n    $array = ['a', ['b', 'c'], ['d', ['e', 'f']]];\n    $iterator = new RecursiveIteratorIterator(\n        new RecursiveArrayIterator($array)\n    );\n    \n    foreach ($iterator as $value) {\n        echo $value . PHP_EOL;\n    }\n    // a b c d e f\n\n?>",
